<tr>
	<td valign="top">
		<table width="100%"  cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
		<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="100%" class="article_column">
				
<div class="contentpaneopen">






<div class="article-content">
<TABLE class=mceItemTable border=0 width=678>
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD width=672>
<TABLE class=mceItemTable border=0 width=675>
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" mce_style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/depan/mktg.jpg" width=200 height=152 mce_src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/depan/mktg.jpg"></P></TD>
<TD>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" mce_style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/sels.jpg" width=200 height=152 mce_src="/images/sels.jpg"></P></TD>
<TD><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/depan/peresmi.jpg" width=200 height=152 mce_src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/depan/peresmi.jpg"></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD style="TEXT-ALIGN: left" mce_style="text-align: left;">Marketing&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;kami&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;melalui &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Sales Promotion&nbsp; &nbsp;Girls&nbsp; &nbsp;&amp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Sales &nbsp;Promotion Boys menyalurkan &nbsp;produk obat&nbsp;gosok " Kera&nbsp; Sakti "&nbsp;&nbsp; ini&nbsp;&nbsp; langsung&nbsp;&nbsp;kepada konsumen&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;di &nbsp;&nbsp;seputar&nbsp;&nbsp; Jakarta &nbsp;&nbsp; &amp; sekitarnya, &nbsp;dan akan terus menyebar. Kami mengharapkan agar produk obat gosok " Kera Sakti " ini&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;akan&nbsp;&nbsp; makin dikenal,<A href="http://www.kerasakti.net/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=200&amp;amp;Itemid=177" target=_self mce_href="http://www.kerasakti.net/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=200&amp;amp;Itemid=177">read more...</A><BR></TD>
<TD style="TEXT-ALIGN: left" mce_style="text-align: left;"><SPAN lang=IN>Selasih&nbsp; berkhasiat&nbsp;&nbsp;untuk &nbsp;membantu meredakan pegal-pegal, linu-linu, dan nyeri &nbsp;pada &nbsp;persendian,&nbsp; menurunkan kadar&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;asam&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;urat &nbsp; ,&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;membantu memperbaiki&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; sirkulasi&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; darah , memperkuat &nbsp;fungsi&nbsp; ginjal , dll. &nbsp;Anda hanya&nbsp; perlu&nbsp; mengkonsumsi&nbsp; sehari 3 kali @ 2&nbsp;kapsul setelah makan ,&nbsp; <A href="http://www.kerasakti.net/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=198&amp;amp;Itemid=175" target=_self mce_href="http://www.kerasakti.net/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=198&amp;amp;Itemid=175">read more...</A><BR></SPAN></TD>
<TD style="TEXT-ALIGN: left" mce_style="text-align: left;">Atas&nbsp; rahmat Tuhan Yang Maha&nbsp; Esa , maka&nbsp;&nbsp;pada hari Kamis, 25 November 2010 , kami telah meresmikan pabrik obat&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;gosok&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Kera&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Sakti&nbsp; &nbsp; yang beralamat &nbsp;di&nbsp;&nbsp;Jl. &nbsp;Bintang &nbsp;Mas no. 6, Km&nbsp; 47,5 ,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cibinong &nbsp;, BOGOR, <A href="http://www.kerasakti.net/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=201&amp;amp;Itemid=178" target=_self mce_href="http://www.kerasakti.net/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=201&amp;amp;Itemid=178">read more...</A><BR></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE><BR>
<TABLE class=mceItemTable border=0 width=675>
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><IMG src="http://a5.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/308763_1973001737948_1630191764_1525304_71393004_n.jpg" width=660 height=27 mce_src="http://a5.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/308763_1973001737948_1630191764_1525304_71393004_n.jpg"><BR></DIV></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD>
<P>- Lomba Karaoke Imlek Betawi Radio Cakrawala &amp; Obat gosok Kera Sakti ( 1 November 2011 – 31 Januari 2012 )</P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify" mce_style="text-align: justify;">Kalau anda <EM>hobby nyanyi</EM> dan suka lagu Mandarin, ingin menjadi <EM>artis penyanyi</EM>, <EM>rekaman bareng artis penyanyi Rani Pancarani</EM>, serta meraih hadiah senilai <EM>puluhan juta rupiah</EM>, maka ikutilah Lomba Karaoke Imlek Betawi&nbsp;Radio Cakrawala (98,3 FM) &amp; obat gosok Kera Sakti ( 1 November 2011 - 31 Januari 2012 ), yaitu suatu acara kerja sama antara Radio Cakrawala (98,3 FM) dan obat gosok Kera Sakti; yang juga merupakan sponsor tunggal dalam acara tersebut. <STRONG><EM>Caranya</EM></STRONG> <STRONG>telepon</STRONG> ke <STRONG>021-98307733</STRONG> untuk pendaftaran atau kirimkan <STRONG>SMS</STRONG>, ketik "<STRONG>KARAOKE</STRONG>", kirimkan ke <STRONG>083815009830</STRONG>.. <A href="http://www.kerasakti.net/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=213&amp;amp;Itemid=187" target=_self mce_href="http://www.kerasakti.net/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=213&amp;amp;Itemid=187">read more... </A><BR mce_bogus="1"></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE><BR>
<TABLE class=mceItemTable border=0 width=675>
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD colSpan=3>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" mce_style="text-align: center;"><IMG src="http://a3.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/308763_1973001777949_1630191764_1525305_1550266813_n.jpg" width=660 height=28 mce_src="http://a3.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/308763_1973001777949_1630191764_1525305_1550266813_n.jpg"></P></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/1.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/1.jpg"><BR></DIV></TD>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><IMG src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/2.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/2.jpg"><BR></DIV></TD>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/3.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/3.jpg"></DIV></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/4.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/4.jpg"><BR></DIV></TD>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/5.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/5.jpg"><BR></DIV></TD>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/6.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/6.jpg"></DIV></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/7.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/7.jpg"><BR></DIV></TD>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/8.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/8.jpg"><BR></DIV></TD>
<TD>
<DIV align=center><img src="http://www.kerasakti.net/images/home/gallery/9.jpg" width=220 mce_src="/images/home/gallery/9.jpg"></DIV></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></div>



</div>

